WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.583 --> 00:00:17.791
I couldn't even bring myself to say one last goodbye

00:00:18.208 --> 00:00:24.125
So listen to this, my future self

00:00:50.166 --> 00:01:01.625
All the bygone days are still vivid, as if right in front of me

00:01:03.375 --> 00:01:13.291
And every day when I walked back from school, all I did was watch you from far away

00:01:13.625 --> 00:01:20.083
On this winding road of growing up

00:01:20.083 --> 00:01:26.083
Passing through endless branches of destiny

00:01:26.291 --> 00:01:33.333
If on that day I'd poured my heart out, told you how I truly felt

00:01:33.333 --> 00:01:38.500
Tell me, what we could have been?

00:01:38.625 --> 00:01:39.041
So

00:01:39.041 --> 00:01:45.125
I couldn't even bring myself to say one last thank-you

00:01:45.458 --> 00:01:51.291
Even now, after all this time, I have no answer

00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:57.500
Scattered words that whirl through empty space, let them become song

00:01:57.500 --> 00:02:03.916
Let it ring and carry all the way

00:02:03.916 --> 00:02:10.166
The heartfelt words that reached me, lit the road where paths divide

00:02:10.375 --> 00:02:16.166
I have finally become who I was always gonna be

00:02:16.375 --> 00:02:22.791
I'll weave the past and now together tightly through my heart

00:02:22.791 --> 00:02:31.750
Once more to the future I march on step by step

